経営計画に基づく第１次３ヵ年経営計画（2027～2029 年度）においては、株主還元の方針として、2029 年度の特別損益を除く連結配当性向目標を40％とするとともに、本３ヵ年経営計画において累進配当方針を継続し、目標に向け継続的な増配を目指してまいります。　 今回、これら方針を勘案し、2026 年11 月期の期末配当予想を前回予想の１株当たり27 円から10 円増配し、37 円に修正することといたしました。　 これにより、年間の１株当たり配当金は、前回予想から10 円増配となる64 円になる予定です。　 なお、本件につきましては、2027 年２月開催予定の定時株主総会に付議する予定です。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDate", "PreviousReportingDate", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026年1月13日", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 27, "27.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 27, "27.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 54, "54.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 37, "37.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 64, "64.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 27, "27.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 26, "26.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 46, "46.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["NoteToDividends", "Note